@host = http://localhost:9292
@token = 

### Info & konfigurasi service
GET {{host}}/health

### Daftar voice (perlu token bila diaktifkan)
GET {{host}}/voices?token={{token}}

### Panggil nomor antrian (kontrak dipakai erp/backend)
GET {{host}}/call?number=A003&counter=1&service=Umum&repeat=1&token={{token}}

### Panggil fase sedang diproses (phase=serving)
GET {{host}}/call?number=A003&counter=1&service=Umum&phase=serving&token={{token}}

### Panggil fase selesai (phase=done)
GET {{host}}/call?number=A003&counter=1&service=Umum&phase=done&token={{token}}

### Bacakan teks bebas (halaman Uji Suara)
GET {{host}}/speak?text=Selamat%20pagi%2C%20mohon%20perhatian.&repeat=1&token={{token}}

### Hentikan bacaan
GET {{host}}/stop?token={{token}}
